  "id": "afghan-style-chicken-korma-with-sour-plums",
  "name": "Afghan-Style Chicken Korma with Sour Plums",
  "subtitle": "A gently spiced chicken braise with tart fruit and yogurt",
  "description": "Bone-in chicken simmers with aromatics, tomatoes, yogurt, chana dhal, and dried sour fruit for a rich, tangy main dish.",
